{"ID":"20240522082306-biwmghx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082306-biwmghx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082306-biwmghx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084144-zi366iw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084408-r8h0dk7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2435,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522084144-65psfpf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:18,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:28\u0026#125;","title":"張孟超醫師的葶藶大棗湯案例","type":"doc","updated":"20240522084506"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522084144-zi366iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-zi366iw","updated":"20240522084158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葶藶大棗瀉肺湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案例【一】喘不得臥"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-w1ypsp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-w1ypsp2","updated":"20240522084200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＜金匱＞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疾飲咳嗽病第十二："}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-c7ylnex","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-c7ylnex","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.咳逆倚息，不得臥，其形如腫，謂之支飲。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-36pwlmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-36pwlmu","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.肺飲不弦，但苦喘短氣。支飲亦喘而不能臥，加短氣，其脈平也。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-x1qddmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-x1qddmf","updated":"20240522084203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.支飲不得息，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葶藶大棗瀉肺湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-bro86cn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-bro86cn","updated":"20240522084205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.肺癰，喘不得臥，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葶藶大棗瀉肺湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-yq18fgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-yq18fgz","updated":"20240522084207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.肺癰，胸滿脹，一身面目浮腫，鼻塞清涕出，不聞香臭酸辛，咳逆上氣，喘鳴迫塞者，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葶藶大棗瀉肺湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-agl810s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-agl810s","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎3-24-2007"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-24rrmps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-24rrmps","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"D.M.， 70歲，男性，瘦高，個性剛毅，滿頭白髮，臉上條紋深而有力，看得出經歷不少風霜。素有牛皮癬、高血壓、心臟肥大、動脈硬化，咳嗽、、、等一籮筐問題，當然，也服了一籮筐西藥。今日來看診，主要是為了咳嗽而來。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-65psfpf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-65psfpf","updated":"20240522084506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我問他：咳了多久？忘了，有幾年了吧。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(多是內傷痰飲之症)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-xaybro8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-xaybro8","updated":"20240522084504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"        有痰嗎？什麻顏色？白痰。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(應是寒痰)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-69bjkom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-69bjkom","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粘稠或清稀？粘粘的不易喀出。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-bsex0z4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-bsex0z4","updated":"20240522084500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳之前喉嚨會不會癢？對極了，我一定要咳到痰出來才不癢，但過沒多久又開始癢。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(此乃水氣上沖之症)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-xnv7gke","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-xnv7gke","updated":"20240522084457"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"        怕冷嗎？不會。頭痛或身體疼痛？沒有。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(確定沒有表証)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-lu9ctn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-lu9ctn4","updated":"20240522084456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴不渴？渴。想喝冷水還是溫水？冷水"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(已有里熱之象)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-5gjcwc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-5gjcwc7","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再問：胃口如何？還好。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-mwm5gs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-mwm5gs5","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下舌診：苔白厚而膩。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-m1v4h30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-m1v4h30","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：右寸滑有力。左關弦"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-4p3valb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-4p3valb","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此乃肺有寒痰，兼有里熱之證，我開立處方：【射干麻黃湯加石膏、杏仁】。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-m4w11q9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-m4w11q9","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎4-16-2007"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-b1jd9us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-b1jd9us","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病人告知，喉癢減輕一點點，但咳嗽並未改善多少，一打電話就咳得更厲害，而且半夜2~3點都會咳醒。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-gbntyrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-gbntyrl","updated":"20240522084434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我即刻問他：感到噁心嗎？會呀，口乾口苦？是的。上回就有這個症狀嗎？嗯。您怎麼沒告訴我？你又沒問我！"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(確實是我的疏忽)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-l32zl43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-l32zl43","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"麻煩您躺下，讓我按一按您的胸腹。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-d5zdafb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-d5zdafb","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下腹診：右脅下苦滿，心下滿，重壓則痛，胸口躁而略熱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-rg6fvpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-rg6fvpy","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌診：苔黃而膩。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-0az54gg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-0az54gg","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：右寸滑，左脈弦。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-6kzbb0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-6kzbb0c","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此為少陽兼痰飲，金剋木。於是改以處方：【柴陷湯合苓甘姜味辛夏仁湯】。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-fv2qybd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-fv2qybd","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"◎6-14-2007"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-ao8wg0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-ao8wg0z","updated":"20240522084428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上方服後病人即感到舒服許多，但一星期後咳嗽又開始增多，到了昨夜，咳嗽轉劇，咳到喉痛，變成胸口脹滿，呼吸困難而喘，幾乎不能躺下來睡。只有坐著比較能休息。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（難道又是十棗湯証？）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-kijam9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-kijam9x","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刻下舌診：舌苔淡黃膩，舌根部苔厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-2ln0lnw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-2ln0lnw","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈診：雙脈滑數。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-1z8v5m0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-1z8v5m0","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"腹診：右脅下苦滿減輕，心下滿，胸口躁而略熱，起伏較速。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-7n9ls22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-7n9ls22","updated":"20240522084426"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"問病人：您的痰是什麼樣子？黃而粘稠。口渴？是的。惡寒嗎？不會。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"（非十棗湯証也）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-xlxkboo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-xlxkboo","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方：【葶藶(5錢)大棗瀉肺湯合上方加減】一劑。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-qtpnzbp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-qtpnzbp","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    詢問得知：服藥後，吐大量黃痰，鼻涕出，當晚即能躺下睡覺，只剩輕微咳嗽，胸口脹滿若失，似乎幾年來堆在胸口的痰都清出來了。病人告訴我，早該下這個藥了，害他辛苦這麼久！"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-tc14syd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-tc14syd","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"後記："}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-w5lgjrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-w5lgjrj","updated":"20240522084243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此後2008年以漢唐系列、HT16治乾癬、HT68護肝丸，HT40鳥梅丸苦溫化濕法治其牛皮癬，已逐步改善中。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如倪師所言鳥梅丸須以丸劑效佳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，學生試以湯、散確不如丸劑。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-rqkqyrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-rqkqyrs","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"學生孟超報告到此"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-mpkzob1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-mpkzob1","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7-4-2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-ktc8xix","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-ktc8xix","updated":"20240522084144"}},{"ID":"20240522084144-cpnh3v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-cpnh3v1","updated":"20240522084249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以下羅列條文類比，及"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"恩師所言"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，以便各位師兄姊檢閱。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-7x0ggz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-7x0ggz3","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\u003c咳逆/喘/不得臥\u003e"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-6hpdfqw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-6hpdfqw","updated":"20240522084422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＜金匱＞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-hhymrw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-hhymrw6","updated":"20240522084326"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.咳逆倚息，不得臥，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小青龍湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曰：小青龍湯使用時機必有表証，無明顯表証則用射干麻黃湯。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-r4agte9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-r4agte9","updated":"20240522084324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.咳逆上氣，時時唾濁，但坐不得眠，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"皂莢丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曰：此為黃膠痰(抽煙之人)使用時機。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-emq3nhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-emq3nhc","updated":"20240522084307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.咳逆倚息，不得臥，其形如腫，謂之支飲。夫有支飲家，咳煩，胸中痛者，不卒死，至一百日或一歲，宜"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"十棗湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-2aqpift","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-2aqpift","updated":"20240522084310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.支飲不得息，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葶藶大棗瀉肺湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-k7l9m2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-k7l9m2e","updated":"20240522084319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.肺癰，喘不得臥，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葶藶大棗瀉肺湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曰：葶藶大棗瀉肺湯必為肺熱黃痰與十棗湯水飲病不同；又，若肺熱黃痰能臥，則是千金葦莖湯使用時機，而非葶藶大棗瀉肺湯。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-yy2208t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-yy2208t","updated":"20240522084144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\u003c非因咳喘不得臥\u003e"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-excnfr8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-excnfr8","updated":"20240522084417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＜金匱＞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-aw4dh3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-aw4dh3d","updated":"20240522084331"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、婦人病，飲食如故，煩熱不得臥，而反倚息…轉胞，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"腎氣丸"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-mxgusyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-mxgusyn","updated":"20240522084335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、產後腹痛，煩滿不得臥，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳實芍藥散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-cufftey","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-cufftey","updated":"20240522084340"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、夫吐血，咳逆上氣，其脈數而閒有熱，不得臥者，死。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曰：大劑甘草干姜湯／理中湯救逆。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-pxlfsqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-pxlfsqs","updated":"20240522084419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"＜傷寒＞"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-l10e09g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-l10e09g","updated":"20240522084347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、病人小便不利，大便作難乍易，時有微熱，喘冒不能臥者，有燥屎也，宜"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大承氣湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-hcskgn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-hcskgn9","updated":"20240522084349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、少陰病，得之二三日以上，心中煩，不得臥，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黃連阿膠湯"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084144-5w7ch3x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084144-5w7ch3x","updated":"20240522084351"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、傷寒發熱，下利厥逆，躁不得臥者，死。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"倪師曰：大劑四逆湯救逆、赤石脂禹餘糧湯止其下利。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084356-6mg081y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084356-6mg081y"}},{"ID":"20240522084352-gagvc1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084352-gagvc1o","updated":"20240522084357"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084404-g0qffty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084404-g0qffty","updated":"20240522084404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同學們大家認為你們的張師兄實力如何? 他真不愧是位非常優秀的正統經方家，世上醫師已經少有其對手了，老師很高興有這位如此優秀的學生出現，我一直在說西醫學是個連咳嗽都無法治好的醫學，既然連咳嗽都沒有辦法治，遑論治療肺癌呢? 就像出生六個月的小寶貝還不會走路，但是他的父母親卻說他會跑步，你們相信嗎? 這是笑話一則，上述案例中的美國西醫師就有平常心，這是值得尊敬的醫師，不像台灣有小部份超爛的西醫師，根本從來沒有學過中醫學，根本不懂什麼才是真正的中醫師，就胡亂的批評中醫學不好，是不科學的醫學，所以台灣有許多西醫師本身連什麼是科學?什麼是科技?都沒搞清楚時，就使用栽贓嫁禍、極盡其污衊的手段，不斷的在打擊中醫，你們這些超爛的西醫師只要繼續這樣做，我就罵你直到你因為吃西藥與維他命過多而得到癌症死亡為止，我絕對不會出手幫你們的，請你們在夜深人靜之時，捫心自問一下，西醫學除了在外科急救上可以幫助到人類之外，真的能治病嗎? 疫苗真的可以預防疾病嗎? 想通了我就幫你，想不通又繼續再接再厲的打擊中醫，那我只好也再接再厲的修理你們這一類的西醫師了，我這樣做的目的只有一個，就是想救人而已，你繼續再害人，我當然不會放過你。但是你如果從今天開始就改變態度，支持正統的中醫學說，當你須要我們經方家的幫忙時，我一定會義不容辭的協助你，也從此不再罵你們了。"}]},{"ID":"20240522084404-7omvras","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084404-7omvras","updated":"20240522084406"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":" 世上最好的醫師是一直在替病人著想的醫師，無所謂中醫?還是西醫? 只要對病人有利的就要鼓勵病人去做，這就是好醫師的定義。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522084404-f4ufx1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084404-f4ufx1h","updated":"20240522084404"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"漢唐中醫  倪海廈 謹記於台北07/07/2008"}]},{"ID":"20240522084407-1ck6iaf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522084407-1ck6iaf"}},{"ID":"20240522084408-r8h0dk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522084408-r8h0dk7"}}]}